SUMMARY:Baja del Sur
DESCRIPTION:The Unstruck Drum Center for Shamanism and Healing\nA returnin
 g to Yandara Retreat Center for Mother Bear and Shoshana to explore our de
 pths through daily yoga and ceremony that communes with the elementals.\n*
 *FOR MORE INFO: [BAJA](https://www.revolutionyoga.net/baja)**\nImmerse you
 rself in the tranquility of our secluded beach resort\, where you can bask
  in the warm sun\, feel the sand beneath your toes\, and let the sound of 
 crashing waves wash away your stress. Take a leisurely hike along breathta
 king trails that will lead you to awe-inspiring vistas\, providing a momen
 t of pure connection with nature. Reinvigorate your senses in our refreshi
 ng salt-water pool\, enveloped by the soothing ambiance of the surrounding
  landscape.\n\n**Our six-day retreat includes:**\nFreshly prepared meals\n
 Daily yoga classes\nMeditation\nChanting and Breathwork\nCeremony & Ritual
 \nOptional Excursions & Adventures\n**FOR MORE INFO: [BAJA](https://www.re
 volutionyoga.net/baja)**
