DESCRIPTION:The Unstruck Drum Center for Shamanism and Healing\nGoddess Ci
 rcle is a safe space to meet in Sisterhood. We will pass the talking stick
 \, share our truth\, and use this space to learn about a Goddess each mont
 h to awaken the Goddess within you. To remember your sovreignty and connec
 t with your highest and most divine parts.\n\n*[REGESTER HERE](https://www
 .eventbrite.com/e/1991408548576?aff=oddtdtcreator)*\n**We wear RED!**\n\nI
 n December\, you are invited to return to the Red Tent\; The space of your
  ancestral wisdom\, matriarchal intelligence\, and intuitive guidance. We 
 will dance in sacred movement and awaken the deepest heat Feminine Fire.\n
 **We Wear RED!**\n*[REGESTER HERE](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1991408548
 576?aff=oddtdtcreator)*
