 //www.eventbrite.com/e/2003677702947?aff=oddtdtcreator)\n\nWE WEAR GREEN t
 o manifest prosperity and abundance in our lives together!\n\n**Goddess Ci
 rcle – Creating Abundance**\n\n**Goddess Circle** meets the first Saturd
 ay of each month to bring you into the loving arms of sisterhood. We conne
 ct with women\, set intentions\, and manifest your desires in a sacred spa
 ce filled with love\, wisdom\, and positive energy. Goddess Circle is for 
 women and those who identify as women.\n\nThis month we will honor the God
 dess Lakshmi to create **Abundance**. We wear green to elevate the Goddess
  frequencies. Through ritual and ceremony we will get clear on what we wan
 t to create in 2027\, learn to have the courage to receive\, and celebrate
  the manifestations in your life.\n\nREGESTER HERE: [https://www.eventbrit
 e.com/e/2003677702947?aff=oddtdtcreator](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/2003
 677702947?aff=oddtdtcreator)\n\nDon’t miss this opportunity to amplify y
 our dreams into manifestation.
